    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Where...where am I...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "I remember I was sleeping"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "and when I woke up, I was here..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Mommy, have you seen my mommy?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "I wanna go home...*Sob*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "About the witch"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "About the curse"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Cancel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Witch...? I've never seen a witch, but I've read about them in books. I'm not sure if they exist or not, but it would be so horrifying if they did..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Why is it so cold in here...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "A-aren't you cold, or even scared? I wanna go home... It's warm over there. Could you help me get back... Please...? H-help me..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "A c-curse...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "My grandma says that there are lots of curses in the world. Some of them, you can tell it's a curse. But there are other curses that follow you throughout life..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Grandma says curses can take other forms... Like if someone's always mad at you, and won't forgive you, you can see that as a curse too."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "My grandma told me there's only one spell that can break a strong curse that you can't lift with Blessings..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Klaatu..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Verata....."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Ne...ni...umm...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "What was the last part?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "I-I can't remember"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "the last part of the spell!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "If you repeat the spell in that order, it will release you from someone's anger and hate. And if you do it near a bad spirit, they might get the curse instead."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Why are you asking me about these scary kind of things...? I just wanna go home..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "It's so cold in here..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "I'm freezing..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "And I wanna go home and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "get away from this scary place..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "[Alakina Ann]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Please... help me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Child",
      "text" : "Could you take me with you...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "I sense you're cursed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "by a powerful spell..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Hmm... It's clear what"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "you must be up to...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "You wish to get"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "rid of your curse...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "By giving it to me!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Just because I'm a cursed spirit, you adventurers think you can just dump your curses on me?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "I refuse to let"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "you remain here....."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Leave now, or I will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "remove you by force...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "....And..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "....Whatever you do..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "....Do NOT touch my books..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Touch the first book."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Touch the second book."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Touch the third book."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Okay, I am leaving."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "...!..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "How dare you touch my books"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "when I specifically said"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "'Don't touch my books!'"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "....!...Grrrrr!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "I shall tear you apart...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Be bound by an eternal curse...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "...!..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "You dare touch my books?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Right after I said not"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "to touch them...?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Foolish mortal!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "...BEGONE!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Muhahahaha...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Stubborn mortal~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Fine! I will give you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "a fighting chance and let"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "you cast a spell."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "[Ashe Bruce]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "But Blessings won't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "work with the curse"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "that you have..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "And the spell to lift"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "your curse has been"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "lost to the ages~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Clover"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Cursed Spirit",
      "text" : "Klaatu"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
